flowchart TD
  INPUT[Typed module and selected optimization level] --> BEFORE[Verify and save actual input CIR]
  BEFORE --> EXEC[Execute pass with process CPU timing]
  EXEC --> CHANGED{Transformation events greater than zero}
  CHANGED -->|No| KEEP[Preserve all analysis contracts]
  CHANGED -->|Yes| SHAPE{CFG or sparse constants}
  SHAPE -->|Yes| ALL[Invalidate CFG dominance loops uses effects liveness]
  SHAPE -->|No| VALUES[Preserve CFG dominance loops; invalidate uses effects liveness]
  ALL --> EPOCH[Advance analysis epoch]
  VALUES --> EPOCH
  KEEP --> AFTER[Verify and save actual output CIR]
  EPOCH --> AFTER
  AFTER --> RECORD[Record dimensions events contracts and CPU seconds]
  RECORD --> NEXT{More selected passes}
  NEXT -->|Yes| BEFORE
  NEXT -->|No| PUBLISH[Atomically publish JSON pipeline index]
